               <code code="88436-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="PATIENT COUNSELING INFORMATION"/>
               <title>17 PATIENT COUNSELING INFORMATION</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="underline">Eye Care Precaution</content>
                     <br/>
Advise patients to avoid touching the eye for at least 10 to 20 minutes after using AKTEN as accidental injuries can occur due to insensitivity of the eye.
 </paragraph>
